 Alright, so he’s pretty fat. Did we mention he loves to eat?
 The thing is – he wants to get fit! To do that he needs your help.
 So be prepared to:
 • Get your friend out of bed, and do some physical activities. • Get him running on the treadmill, lifting weights, or maybe jumping rope and boxing. • Make sure he gets enough food after the workout, and a good night''s sleep to recover his stamina. • And please – don''t forget to have fun!
